10 REM HELLO FROM THE APPLE II PLUS
20 REM A HI-RES FAN, THEN THE GREETING DOWN THE TEXT SCREEN
30 REM ALL SEVEN COLOURS AND NOT THE BLACK: HCOLOR= 0 WOULD DRAW A GAP
40 HGR
50 FOR I = 0 TO 279 STEP 8
60 HCOLOR= 1 + I / 8 - 7 * INT (I / 56)
70 HPLOT I,0 TO 279 - I,159
80 NEXT I
90 REM TEXT AND HOME ARE BOTH APPLESOFT'S; INTEGER BASIC HAS NEITHER
100 TEXT
110 HOME
120 FOR I = 1 TO 20
130 VTAB I
140 HTAB 1 + I - 12 * INT (I / 12)
150 PRINT "HELLO FROM THE APPLE II PLUS"
160 NEXT I
170 REM FLASH IS APPLESOFT'S TOO - THE CHARACTER GENERATOR BLINKS THE
180 REM BANNER BY ITSELF, SO NO PROGRAM HAS TO TIME IT
190 VTAB 23
200 HTAB 14
210 FLASH
220 PRINT "* BASICALLY *"
230 NORMAL
240 END
